  "reason": "With no completed experiments, the key uncertainty is whether a simple RNA-only model provides a useful performance baseline before testing more complex profile, encoder, image, or fusion choices. config_001 tests a minimal RNA-only single-profile PCA baseline, which will establish reference validation accuracy and F1 for later comparisons with multiprofile settings, learned RNA encoders, image-only models, and multimodal fusion. It is the best first use of budget because it is simple, low-risk, and creates a necessary anchor for isolating the effects of other design decisions."
}

